    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedajeega Ghaydidanda ea doobiiwnata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga sean bwat geat bea Israeli, Gajawoosa ghaydidi; aba gideaba Aniineeda was NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA geawooschi ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giliwas sih aba jeedeang'wa dasisiina mureeda ghaamwat ea ghwaan, nea ghoang'waanyi sabaatoheedeanyu: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiyami geaw ak gibwadi sanaamu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gidamawoosa ASEETA.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ghana asisiina geat sanaamajeega gharinga: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyoataydi lukghumeeda was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gajeatayda ak abeeda geamwaseagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeayaak eaweeda iidaydaawi, ghana iimuchu; nea gidabit ea ghwahita eaweeteaba samwagu gajeaghwardaawa beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa eayaak eaweeteaba samwagu, abeeda eamuy; mwajeamwas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siida wassean iiyak gayghwasar munyindaanyi, aba gideaba nibwara ririnnyeanda gidaghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA; ak abeeda siidida gajeasach aba jeeda fugaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyoang'eachi lajita booga aba ng'eanyiideang'wa, ea adoalaji madameegeagwa ea aduulni, nea adoawaamnyi gheaptanga iing'ata lajita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea adoobichi sabiiboodeang'wa ea goosha, nea adiidu gooliimnyi sabiibajeega abitpit bea madameegeagwa; gajanung'waada aba badahuuka fuga barbari ea rabasta: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu goojagwadiischi, ghana reengana siida, ghana anapiisiina geat ng'uyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea adiidu giyaagi habeawooda aba gheawungeasu nea ginabayi ng'uyeega, ak gibwari ririnnyeanda gheawunga ASEATAANG'U: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu giighabwasi gischeewoocheandaang'u ghana areeda gida. Nea gidageatinda siida siitaw gadiyeeda ea adagoobiida headaang'u eaweesean ea gamuchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gimwaashti siida miy ghana wiila uranyeanda aba madeeda siida ng'oaw, gidabal giiwali gheang'da ASEATAANG'U: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu ghoalaji girgweageeda nea meatoabiiwi; ak ea adishiidi siida bwarbwar ghana awala gheang'da siida haw, gagasa laja girgweageeda gischeewoocheandaang'u nea giidoabiiwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiweelweeldi siida naba ng'uyeega aba jeeda fugaagu, nea adimiinaadi aba badayda foojeanda gischeewoocheandaang'u. Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu gisti orjeeda geamadu aba gurooroadaang'u, asi reekusiina gischeewoocheandaang'u, adiidu gisareani riing'eeda aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiwaldi mureandooda ghana sina furjeeda wassean aba badahuuka fugaagu ang'iing'i, gagasa bwariiyda gischeewoocheandaang'u gidubwariiydi geaw. Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ang'waanya deaweedajeegeasu. Adiidu ginung' gwajiilsiinyi dugwaagu sea gea mawuurji; ak ea adihisi madamnyeandaang'u heeluut iyeenya bea mbeeyooda; ghana akwealsiina saseadaang'u hang'weaka iyeenya siikuuyi nea mawuurji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iluudayi sea gatmooda was soomjeanda, nea goonyeari siinuut nea mii gwarada gheenda ghana eanung' goobal geaw, gajeayaaga ghoorjooda. Ak ea majeenuus, aba gideaba meabala geaw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygweadu haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea giidiinyeanda aba badaydaanyi heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gidaghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, gajea lagweenda gil was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea giidiinyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwasin ashoohoocheanda giiduupcheeda aba badayda siida aba lagweenda was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea giidiinyeanda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda riing'eadaanyi ghayi sin; nea riing'eeda ghayi nisin gajeesamsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyoapkaanyi jeedeaba ng'eang'i ak goohisti heeluutka sean bea geediga siyeaga, abeeda ea adoayaaji haghweagaaschi; gajeaheawa gweanyeew samwagu majayaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama gweaydeaba ang'wan abeeda haghweega nyaawa sean gajea ghaydidi, was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda jea eakghaambiida NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahita gweaydeaba muut abeeda ghoamuuschi ayaaga haghweega nyaawa, ak abeeda ghwasaang'ayiit boogeagwa: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Majayaaga banyeega wassean guuyi sea foojeanda. Ak ea adooscheeng'u meanga nea adoong'ushooshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoareakghuchi murdajeega iheengeagwa nea gooneaweesi ghana murdajeega deamuukeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu goosisi sasanuukeagwa siireadayda wassean aba badayda siida meah ghana sina ng'ooruutka wassean aba saseadaang'u: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu gibwari darari hudaang'u ak ginung' gwahiseada, ak abeeda ghoabita ng'eanyiida jeeda hiseadayeanduumeeda ak ghwanyiit jeeda ng'eanyiida munyinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'waanya sabaatohajeegeasu nea goosisi mureeda heeda sigadoowaniisean: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aduwi heeda fuga ascheeng'u ng'eanyiida ghana beeneediga; adiidu gigasayi fiisu, ak ghabwaraneey saawa ririnnyeanda: aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iissa gisisi mureeda siida mideawa ghearashka, nea giiwali gheang'da siida waas, ak abeeda gajawala gheang'da ASEETA: aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea rabascheanda mida jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa, ea adiidu gisimi ng'asheanda muy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabascheanda mida jeedeang'wa anung' ghoah siideaba ng'eang'i, nea ghoabwariiydi gidubwariiydi geaw; aba gideaba agooga ghayi goowooschi rabasta aba ng'eanyiida Misri: aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu gimunyiidi lajita girgweageeda, aba iideeni geawunda ghana durumanata ghana seang'ayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina ng'asheega nea gideeneadi aba gideenooda, ea hawunda, ea eefa, ea hiinayda hit: aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ghayi eananeegwa ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajang'waanya deaweedajeegeasu ea diigheanyeekeasu sean, ak goosinyi aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
